@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Register
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "email": "admin@example.com",
    "password": "admin123",
    "name": "Admin"
}

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "email": "admin@example.com",
    "password": "admin123"
}

### Me (usa o cookie access_token salvo no login/register)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me HTTP/1.1

### Refresh (usa o cookie refresh_token e devolve novos cookies)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh HTTP/1.1

### Logout (revoga a sessão e limpa os cookies)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout HTTP/1.1
